WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Your robot customer wants coffee that tastes like Friday. Ask questions, or improvise?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Pick an option and see what happens next. Your friend can choose differently.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Three decisions lead to one of four endings. It’s a fictional game, not a personality test.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Edit a starter, or ask AI for a draft. Review the scenes and endings before sharing.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Create an unlisted link for friends to play and remix. Try Relay free. AI requests are limited.
